    <!-- Help Dialog -->
    <string name="help_title">Inventory Calculation Rules</string>
    <string name="help_content">1. Closing Adults = Opening Adults + Adults Added - Adult Deaths - Adults Sold.\n\n2. Closing Chicks = Opening Chicks + Chicks Added - Chick Deaths - Chicks Sold.\n\n3. Total Live Birds = Closing Adults + Closing Chicks.\n\n4. Total Deaths Today = Adult Deaths + Chick Deaths.\n\n5. Daily Mortality Rate = (Total Deaths / Opening Total Live Birds) × 100. (If opening is 0, displays N/A).\n\n6. The closing count of today automatically becomes tomorrow\'s opening balance.\n\n7. Editing or deleting past records automatically updates all subsequent inventory balances.</string>
    
